GAL16V8
Gates

; Pin list: pins 1-10 on the first line, 11-20 on the second.
; NC = not connected. Inputs A-D on pins 2-5; outputs on pins 12-19.
NC   A    B    C    D    NC   NC   NC   NC   GND
NC   AND  OR   XOR  NAND NOTA AND4 MAJ  PASS VCC

; One gate per output. * = AND, + = OR, / = NOT.
AND  = A * B                   ; pin 12
OR   = A + B                   ; pin 13
XOR  = A * /B + /A * B         ; pin 14: 1 when A and B differ
NAND = /A + /B                 ; pin 15: not (A and B)
NOTA = /A                      ; pin 16
AND4 = A * B * C * D           ; pin 17
MAJ  = A * B + A * C + B * C   ; pin 18: 1 when two or more of A, B, C are 1
PASS = A                       ; pin 19

DESCRIPTION

Bench test for MiniGecko (MINIGECKO-011): eight combinational outputs from
four inputs, each a gate you can check with switches on A-D and a meter or
LEDs on pins 12-19. Decompiled equations should read back as written here.
